{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1187050-changeling-jobs-and-lifestyles","id":1187050,"title":"Changeling jobs and lifestyles","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-17T08:52:21-08:00","id":1187050,"title":"Changeling jobs and lifestyles","content":"The world is full of soul crushing, banal jobs. But there are all kinds of career paths for oddballs (including fae). Weird hours, unusual job requirements, strange client base, etc.<br /> <br /> What sorts of jobs, careers etc do you invision Changelings having ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-17T12:57:28-08:00","id":1187123,"title":"","content":"Caretaker of a cemetery (see the film Cemetery Man (2004)). Manga artist. Farm veterinarian. Fashion designer. &quot;Cool Hunter&quot; (see William Gibson's novel Pattern Recognition). Bike messenger. Park ranger. Martial arts instructor. Chef. Professional escort. Musician. Youtube celebrity. Computer programer. Cowgirl. Gunsmith. Midwife. Professional gambler. Private tutor. Bodyguard. Cat burglar. Club DJ. Bounty hunter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T17:52:41-07:00","id":1201085,"title":"","content":"A local dreamer/kinain has offered a job at a bookstore. He pays the troll who works there to do menial tasks, but expects the changeling to rush off on an adventure at a moment's notice without a word. Sometimes offering words of wisdom and quests to help the troll keep banality at bay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23984-thkaal","name":"Thkaal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T17:56:06-07:00","id":1201090,"title":"","content":"Hitman, Thief, Gigalo, and Bitminer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attach