.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm, some of those look pretty banal to me...!<br /> <br /> However any of them that can be prefixed with the word 'Freelance' work okay.<br /> <br /> e.g.<br /> <br /> Manga Artist can be a soul crushingly awful job where you're stuck in an office 16 hours a day grinding out comics by hand (ref: <a href=\"https://www.quora.com/What-is-life-like-as-a-manga-artist\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.quora.com/What-is-life-l...a-manga-artist</a>)<br /> On the other hand Freelance Manga Artist sounds like the sort of job where you can do what you want when you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11490-dogstar","name":"Dogstar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11490_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T12:17:54-07:00","id":1201358,"title":"","content":"Gambler!<br /> <br /> Professional Scape Goat.<br /> <br /> Disney Mascot Actor!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T12:29:27-07:00","id":1201360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dogstar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changel